{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /home/ac/.claude/skills/brainstorming\n\n# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you're building, present the design in small sections (200-300 words), checking after each section whether it looks right so far.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, docs, recent commits)\n- Ask questions one at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice questions when possible, but open-ended is fine too\n- Only one question per message - if a topic needs more exploration, break it into multiple questions\n- Focus on understanding: purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n**Exploring approaches:**\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches with trade-offs\n- Present options conversationally with your recommendation and reasoning\n- Lead with your recommended option and explain why\n\n**Presenting the design:**\n- Once you believe you understand what you're building, present the design\n- Break it into sections of 200-300 words\n- Ask after each section whether it looks right so far\n- Cover: architecture, components, data flow, error handling, testing\n- Be ready to go back and clarify if something doesn't make sense\n\n## After the Design\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Write the validated design to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`\n- Use elements-of-style:writing-clearly-and-concisely skill if available\n- Commit the design document to git\n\n**Implementation (if continuing):**\n- Ask: \"Ready to set up for implementation?\"\n- Use superpowers:using-git-worktrees to create isolated workspace\n- Use superpowers:writing-plans to create detailed implementation plan\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Don't overwhelm with multiple questions\n- **Multiple choice preferred** - Easier to answer than open-ended when possible\n- **YAGNI ruthlessly** - Remove unnecessary features from all designs\n- **Explore alternatives** - Always propose 2-3 approaches before settling\n- **Incremental validation** - Present design in sections, validate each\n- **Be flexible** - Go back and clarify when something doesn't make sense\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ed0ea99-7e37-4320-8594-34538afe20bd","uuid":"31754b00-364a-44bc-ae95-a0c30e7e6d2f","isSynthetic":true}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_3bdf167fac1b49d6b678d5cd","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n    17→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n    25→  - 6 differential items with icons\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n    41→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n    42→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n    43→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n    44→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n    46→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    47→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n    48→\n    49→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    50→- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n    51→- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n    52→- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n    53→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n    54→\n    55→---\n    56→\n    57→## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n    58→- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    59→- Files changed:\n    60→  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n    61→- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n    62→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n    63→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    64→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    65→  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n    66→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    67→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n    68→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    69→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n    70→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    71→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    72→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    73→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    74→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    75→- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n    76→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n    77→- **Verification**:\n    78→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    79→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    80→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    81→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    82→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    83→\n    84→**Learnings:**\n    85→- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n    86→- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n    87→- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n    88→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n    89→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n    90→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n    91→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    92→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n    93→\n    94→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    95→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n    96→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n    97→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n    98→- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n    99→- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n   100→\n   101→---\n   102→\n   103→## 2025-02-08 - US-050\n   104→- Created complete website for Dra. Amanda Gaipo - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   105→- Files changed:\n   106→  - `site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo/index.html` (new)\n   107→- **Design Concept**: Twilight Lavender & Mocha aesthetic with warm lavender, soft mocha, and champagne accents. Contemporary and fashion-forward while maintaining premium elegance. Triple organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n   108→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Lato (body) for sophisticated, modern readability\n   109→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   110→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   111→  - Triple organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n   112→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   113→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n   114→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   115→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n   116→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   117→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   118→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   119→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   120→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   121→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 2042 - Sala - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-190 | (16) 99456-3928\n   122→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo\n   123→- **Verification**:\n   124→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n   125→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n   126→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n   127→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n   128→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   129→\n   130→**Learnings:**\n   131→- **Pattern**: Twilight Lavender & Mocha palette creates a contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic that appeals to a younger, trend-conscious demographic while maintaining premium positioning\n   132→- **Pattern**: Triple organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic`, `--radius-organic-2`, `--radius-organic-3`) create maximum variety in blob animations\n   133→- **Pattern**: Lato body font provides excellent readability while maintaining modern feel - better than Inter for this aesthetic\n   134→- **Gotcha**: The lavender-mocha palette feels more sophisticated and fashion-forward than both the rose/gold (US-048) and sage/pearl (US-049) options\n   135→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond + Lato is an excellent pairing for sophisticated yet readable designs\n   136→- **Gotcha**: Adding gradient fade background (`--gradient-fade`) creates subtle transitions between sections\n   137→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   138→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n   139→\n   140→---\n   141→\n   142→## 2025-02-08 - US-051\n   143→- Created complete website for Dra. Priscila Blazzi - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   144→- Files changed:\n   145→  - `site-demo/dra-priscila-blazzi/index.html` (new)\n   146→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal Emerald & Silk aesthetic with deep emerald greens, silk cream backgrounds, and champagne gold accents. Fresh, sophisticated, and luxurious - a completely new direction from previous palettes (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha). Geometric-elliptic shapes create modern, architectural take on blobmorphism.\n   147→- **Typography**: Bodoni Moda (display) paired with Source Sans 3 (body) for sophisticated, high-contrast elegance with modern readability\n   148→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   149→  - Animated hero with 4 floating elliptic backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   150→  - Geometric-elliptic border-radius patterns (`--radius-ellipse`, `--radius-ellipse-2`, `--radius-ellipse-3`) create architectural, modern shapes\n   151→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   152→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n   153→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   154→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on emerald background\n   155→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   156→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   157→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   158→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   159→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   160→- **Contact Info**: Rua Thomaz Nogueira Gaia, 1090 - sala 01 e 02 - Jardim Sao Luiz, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-270 | (16) 99174-5408\n   161→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-priscila-blazzi\n   162→- **Verification**:\n   163→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n   164→  - Mobile view responsive: ✓\n   165→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n   166→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n   167→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   168→\n   169→**Learnings:**\n   170→- **Pattern**: Ethereal Emerald & Silk palette creates a fresh, sophisticated aesthetic that conveys luxury and renewal - perfect for aesthetic treatments emphasizing transformation and natural beauty\n   171→- **Pattern**: Geometric-elliptic shapes (`70% 30% / 30% 70% 70% 30%`) provide a more architectural, modern interpretation of blobmorphism that differentiates from purely organic shapes\n   172→- **Pattern**: Bodoni Moda as display font adds high-contrast sophistication and elegance - very different from the softer serif fonts used in previous sites\n   173→- **Gotcha**: The emerald-green palette feels more contemporary and fashion-forward while maintaining the premium positioning expected by aesthetic clinic clients\n   174→- **Gotcha**: Emerald tones suggest nature, renewal, and transformation - themes that align perfectly with facial harmonization treatments\n   175→- **Gotcha**: Silk cream backgrounds (`#F7F5F0`) provide warmth without being as yellow-based as champagne tones, creating a cleaner, more modern foundation\n   176→- **Gotcha**: Using emerald as the primary testimonial section background creates strong visual impact and reinforces brand identity\n   177→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   178→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n   179→\n   180→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   181→- **Ethereal Emerald & Silk Palette**: `--color-emerald: #2D7A6E`, `--color-emerald-light: #4A9A8C`, `--color-emerald-dark: #1F5A52`, `--color-silk-cream: #F7F5F0`, `--color-champagne: #C9A86C` - sophisticated, luxurious aesthetic perfect for premium aesthetic clinics\n   182→- **Geometric-Elliptic Border Radius**: `--radius-ellipse: 70% 30% / 30% 70% 70% 30%` creates architectural, modern elliptic shapes that differentiate from organic blobs\n   183→- **Bodoni Moda + Source Sans 3 Typography**: High-contrast serif display font paired with clean, readable sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance\n   184→- **Opulent Rose & Quartz Palette**: `--color-rose: #C8758A`, `--color-rose-light: #D99AA8`, `--color-rose-dark: #A85D6E`, `--color-quartz: #E8D5E0`, `--color-rose-mist: #FDF0F3` - warm, luxurious crystalline aesthetic\n   185→- **Quartz Crystal Border Radius**: `--radius-quartz: 75% 25% / 35% 65% 65% 35%`, `--radius-quartz-2: 55% 45% / 65% 35% 45% 55%`, `--radius-quartz-3: 40% 60% / 55% 45% 35% 65%` for crystalline, geometric shapes\n   186→- **Cormorant Garamond + Outfit Typography**: Classic serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance\n   187→- **Amber & Bronze Noir Palette**: `--color-amber: #D48A3A`, `--color-amber-light: #E5A856`, `--color-amber-dark: #B86F1A`, `--color-bronze: #A67C42`, `--color-ivory: #FAF7F2` - warm, sophisticated amber/bronze tones on ivory backgrounds\n   188→- **Flame Border Radius**: `--radius-flame: 65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%` creates organic flame-like shapes with distinctive flickering animation\n   189→- **Crimson Pro + DM Sans Typography**: Elegant serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated warmth\n   190→\n   191→---\n   192→\n   193→## 2025-02-08 - US-053\n   194→- Created complete website for Dra. Nayara Nubia - Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto\n   195→- Files changed:\n   196→  - `site-demo/dra-nayara-nubia/index.html` (new)\n   197→- **Design Concept**: Amber & Bronze Noir aesthetic with warm amber tones, bronze accents on ivory backgrounds. A completely new warm direction from previous palettes (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz). Flame-shaped border-radius patterns create organic, flickering animations reminiscent of candlelight warmth.\n   198→- **Typography**: Crimson Pro (display) paired with DM Sans (body) for elegant warmth with modern readability\n   199→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   200→  - Animated hero with 4 floating flame-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   201→  - Flame border-radius patterns (`--radius-flame`, `--radius-flame-2`, `--radius-flame-3`) create organic, flickering animations\n   202→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   203→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n   204→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   205→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on amber background\n   206→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   207→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   208→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   209→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   210→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   211→- **Contact Info**: Praça Cornélio Píres, 143 - Jardim America, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-229 | (16) 99302-4664\n   212→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-nayara-nubia\n   213→- **Verification**:\n   214→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n   215→  - Mobile view responsive: ✓\n   216→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n   217→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n   218→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   219→\n   220→**Learnings:**\n   221→- **Pattern**: Amber & Bronze Noir palette creates a warm, sophisticated aesthetic with golden warmth that feels luxurious and approachable - perfect for facial harmonization clinics seeking a modern yet timeless feel\n   222→- **Pattern**: Flame border-radius shapes (`65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%`) provide a more organic interpretation of blobmorphism with unique asymmetrical flickering quality\n   223→- **Pattern**: Crimson Pro + DM Sans typography pairing combines elegant serif warmth with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability\n   224→- **Gotcha**: 