{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209003742966bae11ddb34add","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the complete website for Dra. Paula Meirelles. Based on the progress.md, I've identified several color palettes already used:\n- Ethereal Rose & Gold (US-048)\n- Serene Sage & Pearl (US-049)\n- Twilight Lavender & Mocha (US-050)\n- Ethereal Emerald & Silk (US-051)\n- Opulent Rose & Quartz (US-052)\n- Amber & Bronze Noir (US-053)\n\nI'll create a new distinctive aesthetic: **Velvet Plum & Gold Noir** - a sophisticated, luxurious palette with deep plum tones, warm gold accents, and pearl cream backgrounds. This will be warm, feminine, and premium - perfect for a facial harmonization specialist."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ed0ea99-7e37-4320-8594-34538afe20bd","uuid":"a0eaa9c7-4670-4f4c-99a0-435f50549b81"}
